    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12598" root="دعم" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْمٌ</span></b>  <i>Strength:</i> (TA:) <i>strength and fatness:</i>
(S, TA:) <i>fat and flesh.</i> (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا دَعْمَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِفُلَانٍ</span> <i>There is no strength nor fatness in such a
one.</i> (S, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاِرَيَةٌ ذَاتُ دَعْمٍ</span> <i>A girl,</i> or
<i>young woman, having fat and flesh.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also <i>Much wealth</i> or <i>property.</i> (TA.)

